<title>UK: Rotterdam bunkers little changed, demand fair.</title>
<headline>Rotterdam bunkers little changed, demand fair.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rotterdam bunker prices were little changed on Thursday in reasonabe business totalling about 25,000 tonnes, traders said.</p>
<p>They said 380 cSt fuel was priced at $86/87 a tonne and 180 cSt at $92/93, with Antwerp prices at about the same level.</p>
<p>The Hamburg market was very busy, but there too prices were little changed at $92/93 for 380 cSt and $97/98 for 180 cSt.</p>
<p>In the Gulf, Fujairah prices were steady at $98 and $103 respectively.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4088</p>
